From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 10:29:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: allocate and recycle Direct Switch TX buffers

Implement Direct Switch TX buffer lookup, completion recycling and
statistics while retaining the existing DMA ownership rules.

Split from:
  package/kernel/mac80211/patches/ath12k/906-ath12k-native-ppe-direct-switch.patch - wifi: ath12k: implement native PPE Direct Switch DMA and buffer ownership

Merged from:
